SY_TALK("ea9U8c7xFeI",[[2,["Today we have decided to have the puja of","Shri Krishna."]],[8,["We have many a times done this puja and have","understood the essence of Shri Krishna’s"]],[21,["advent, which was six thousand years back."]],[25,["And now, what His manifestation was, what","He wanted to be accomplished has to be done"]],[44,["in this Kali Yuga."]],[48,["As it is, this Kali Yuga is going into a new","realm of Satya Yuga, but in between there"]],[60,["is Krita Yuga where this Brahmachaitanya,","or we can say the all-pervading Power of God’s"]],[73,["love, is going to act."]],[76,["At this time, what is going to happen with","Shri Krishna’s powers – this is what we"]],[87,["have to see."]],[89,["Shri Krishna, as I told you, was the incarnation","also of diplomacy."]],[95,["So He plays around quite a lot, and ultimately","He brings forth the untruth and the falsehood;"]],[104,["but in doing that He judges people."]],[107,["So it’s very important that Shri Krishna’s","powers of His diplomacy were to be manifesting"]],[115,["at this time, when it is the Last Judgment."]],[120,["So now whatever we have done wrong before,","whatever karmas which have been done in ignorance"]],[134,["maybe, or maybe deliberately, all of them","will be paid back."]],[142,["Those punyas which you have done in previous","lives, this life, will be also rewarded."]],[150,["This is all done through Shri Krishna’s","principles of collectivity, where He collectively"]],[159,["sees the situation."]],[162,["For example, as I told you last time also","that Columbus luckily went to America; luckily,"]],[174,["so we were saved, otherwise we would not have","been here."]],[179,["And then these Spanish people, bullfighters,","they went and started fighting the poor, unarmed"]],[189,["people who were just very simple owners of","that land."]],[195,["But they went and occupied those lands, and","killed every one of them."]],[201,["So in America you can’t find anyone, no","doubt, but even in South America you have"]],[206,["to go to Colombia or to Bolivia, to great","heights, to see some aboriginals there; otherwise"]],[214,["most of them are finished."]],[217,["So now in Krita Yuga all these diseases have","started cropping up."]],[222,["But the best part is the drug addiction."]],[230,["These drugs are made, for your information,","in Bolivia and in Colombia."]],[240,["You drove them down there, so now you have","the drugs and very nicely you are very welcoming"]],[248,["them."]],[250,["People went in Nicaragua to help them and","brought back all these horrible drugs to Washington;"]],[261,["and in every elite society they are just discussing","which is the best drug, where is the sale"]],[267,["on and where should they buy the drugs."]],[271,["So the all of America is now worried how much","drug they can import, and kill themselves"]],[277,["and destroy themselves."]],[280,["So this destruction has started from inside."]],[286,["Then in addition to that, when I went there","first I told them not to indulge into these"]],[293,["Freudian practices but keep to morality, otherwise","you’ll have problems."]],[309,["So they had first AIDS, secondly now yuppie’s","disease, and all kinds of secret diseases"]],[321,["they have."]],[324,["Among ten people there would be at least one","person who is suffering from that, and among"]],[329,["twenty people there’ll be at least one person","who must be suffering from schizophrenia."]],[334,["Because they made every person, every other","country nervous, so now they are getting schizophrenia."]],[343,["Like this we can see even in England."]],[349,["Now in England they came to India as traders,","ordinary traders, and plundered us completely,"]],[361,["no doubt, ruled us for three hundred years","– as I say, it’s gracious hospitality"]],[367,["they had – and then they left us in three","pieces."]],[374,["And now in their own country there are problems,","all kinds."]],[379,["First of all nobody wants to call themselves","as English; they all call themselves Welsh"]],[387,["or Scots, or specially the Irish."]],[392,["And there is always a bomb scare in London,","every time, and for our first program also"]],[397,["there was a bomb scare."]],[399,["So you can imagine these English who tried","to divide us are automatically divided among"]],[406,["themselves, and now fighting each other."]],[408,["But there are other problems also like AIDS","and immoral life, everything like that."]],[414,["Same with the French."]],[417,["French tried to sell their wine all over,","and bring their horrible bathroom culture"]],[424,["everywhere."]],[425,["Now they are suffering from it."]],[428,["For example, most of the time they’re drunk","and they have lost all moorings, I mean, they"]],[434,["have no sense left in their heads."]],[436,["Like a housewife could be a prostitute – allowed","by law."]],[442,["All such things are happening."]],[445,["Now they are paying, and the worst that they","are paying, all these countries who think"]],[451,["no end of themselves, are recession."]],[454,["This is also Shri Krishna’s power, because","He’s Kubera."]],[460,["He’s the one who is the power of wealth."]],[464,["He gave lot of wealth to all these countries,","and now they don’t know what to do with"]],[470,["themselves."]],[471,["We can see in these fifty years how many things","have happened, but specially these twenty"]],[477,["years have been really remarkable."]],[479,["All over the world you can find out there","has been some sort of a complete change, or"]],[490,["an exposure."]],[491,["Even in Italy you see every day this Vatican","is here exposed, or some mafia connections"]],[502,["are there, or this what you call, people from","the government are exposed."]],[509,["I am doing nothing, I’m just sitting here,","but it is working out that way."]],[517,["Since I have been here I don’t know how","many people have gone to jail, God knows."]],[521,["(I don’t know if she’s not brought My","throat pastilles."]],[525,["I had a bath early in the morning, so a little","bit … This is, Shri Krishna is trying to"]],[533,["fill Me up!)"]],[537,["We Indians are also suffering,because our","past deeds – like we had a caste system."]],[555,["So now the caste system has become the greatest","headache for us in India, that’s the greatest"]],[559,["cancer for us."]],[561,["Like that, everywhere these twenty years or","twenty-one years have been … ( … I don’t"]],[571,["know, because morning."]],[576,["Also reaction on Me … ) So like that in","every country, you’ll see gradually, every"]],[593,["country will have to face for what it has","done."]],[600,["Also Shri Krishna’s own style was that He","can never believed in caste system."]],[611,["He Himself was born in a caste which is a,","what you call is a milkman’s caste, and"]],[620,["then He became a king, of course; but to begin","with, and He lived like an ordinary person."]],[628,["He used to take the cows outside, look after","them and bring them home."]],[634,["Now if you see His life you’ll find He is","absolutely very human, the way He used to"]],[644,["tease His mother, tease other ladies."]],[646,["All this is extremely human and childlike,","and extremely sweet."]],[653,["But behind that also there was a great significance."]],[657,["For example, Shri Radha – as you know, She","was Mahalakshmi – and as Mahalakshmi She"]],[665,["used to put Her feet, take bath in the river","Yamuna, and the ladies would take water from"]],[672,["the same river, carry on their head the pitchers."]],[676,["Now Shri Krishna wanted to raise their kundalini,","so He used to hit them from the back so that"]],[683,["the water falls on their back, and that vibrated","water would raise their kundalini."]],[690,["This was His childish trick, but it had a","meaning."]],[694,["Another one, when we see Him in ras – “ra”","means energy."]],[700,["Radha: “ra” is “energy,” “dha”","means “the one who sustains it” – so"]],[706,["it is Radhaji who had the energy."]],[709,["“Sa” means “with,” so when they played","ras, was nothing but to play with the energy."]],[717,["And that’s how He wanted to have a collective","awakening of people, of gopa and gopis, and"]],[722,["He did it."]],[724,["But then He had to leave and fight this Kamsa."]],[727,["In His own lifetime, as a child or grown-up,","He punished all kinds of devils and women"]],[735,["devils who were like Putna, and all that."]],[739,["He did it, and in this Kali Yuga also He’s","active."]],[745,["We have seen how gradually He has finished","so many false gurus, one by one; somebody"]],[751,["who called himself Shri Krishna, somebody","who called himself as God, something else,"]],[757,["something else."]],[758,["He finished them all, exposed them nicely,","and now we have very few people in the arena"]],[762,["left for us to fight."]],[766,["They themselves are trembling and they are","quite frightened of us, because we are standing"]],[770,["on truth."]],[775,["So now, when we have to think about Shri Krishna","who is residing in our Vishuddhi Chakra."]],[783,["Many people have this problem of left Vishuddhi."]],[790,["That is because we are more sort of very social","people."]],[798,["Now in the Western society, the social system","is so rigid that anybody can collapse with"]],[805,["that, or used to be; now better because of","the, maybe the revolt, anti-culture."]],[811,["But otherwise if you could put one spoon from","here to there, then you are finished."]],[818,["If you start your food with, say, not with","the fish knife but with an ordinary knife,"]],[824,["then you’re finished, you are no good."]],[827,["And these French have made even much worse","by using a big science out of alcohol."]],[835,["For this alcohol this is the glass, for that","alcohol that is the glass, and all that."]],[842,["So the whole collective was made so rigid."]],[846,["It’s much more rigid than in India."]],[849,["I used to think Indian collective is quite","rigid because of certain conditionings we"]],[854,["have, but after coming to the West I was surprised","that it is such a conditioning in the heads"]],[866,["of the people, that some of the conditionings","you cannot remove – say from Catholic Church,"]],[873,["you might say, or from wherever it is."]],[875,["But when it comes from somebody like Freud","who was absolutely a devil, they just give"]],[884,["up all these conditionings and take to that."]],[888,["I cannot understand any country where there","is Catholic Church so predominant, they are"]],[895,["following Freud."]],[896,["So this collective rigidity, which was then","because maybe Shri Rama was a very formal"]],[905,["person, because of Him maybe the collective","rigidity might have been in India."]],[913,["But in the West it is all mental, it’s absolutely","mental."]],[919,["If you make this kind of hair then you are","all right, if you put oil then you are absolutely"]],[925,["lunatic: all kinds of funny ideas were given,","and people started doing like this."]],[932,["If you don’t put oil at all you’ll become","bald."]],[934,["If you become bald, then they will have a","business of their wigs."]],[938,["So the whole thing was money-oriented, and","everything was made so fixed that you had"]],[944,["to do it so that they could sell their things."]],[947,["England was, as you know, is tailcoat: you","have to wear a tailcoat if you have to see"]],[952,["the Queen."]],[953,["I don’t know why you have to wear a tailcoat","to see the Queen, but it’s compulsory, and"]],[959,["if you don’t wear then you are not allowed."]],[962,["So they have to borrow these tailcoats and","all that from one shop, which can be tight,"]],[966,["which can be loose, and everybody looks like","Charlie Chaplin to Me!"]],[973,["They can’t walk straight."]],[977,["So this kind of stupid rigidity that came","into the West has really made them very nervous."]],[989,["People are so nervous here."]],[991,["If you tell some lady that “I am going to","come and have food with you,” she will collapse."]],[1000,["God knows what she thinks, I mean, it is caring","for the public opinion, or her own conditioning."]],[1006,["But in an Indian, a housewife, if you tell","her you are going to come, she’ll be the"]],[1013,["happiest person."]],[1014,["She’ll be very happy that you are coming","to her house for dinner."]],[1019,["But here even if you say, “I would like","to come and see you in the evening,” they’ll"]],[1023,["say, “All right, come in the pub.”"]],[1026,["Because they’re so nervous, they’re not","sure of themself; and this has come, I think,"]],[1033,["perhaps from these norms that there have been","created in the West."]],[1037,["In India also we had lots of these ritualism","that came up very serious."]],[1046,["Like we had people, Jainis who’d pick up","their hair with their hands."]],[1054,["They are not supposed to use any knives or","any scissors or any barbers, so they were"]],[1066,["supposed to pick up their hair on their own."]],[1068,["So from their beard, from their this thing,","they would pick up all the time."]],[1073,["That went to such a horrible conditioning","that they would say that if you, even if you"]],[1080,["breathe then you can, you might consume some","animals."]],[1085,["So they would put some sort of a cloth before","their mouth, and all kinds of nonsense they"]],[1091,["did."]],[1092,["At that time Shri Krishna came in."]],[1097,["His own cousin was a tirthankara, you’ll","be surprised, Neminath."]],[1104,["He became a tirthankara, and that made Shri","Krishna think about it, that this kind of"]],[1112,["stupid ritualism that we have."]],[1115,["Like in the morning women will get up, in","their sleep they will go, put some water for"]],[1120,["tulsi, do this thing, that thing, throw water","here and there."]],[1125,["And also the untouchables and touchables;","and you can’t take water from this, you"]],[1131,["can’t eat this, you can’t move like that","– all kinds of restrictions, timing, everything."]],[1138,["This time is not good, that time is not good,","this you should not do, that you should not"]],[1142,["do, to such an extent that the whole movement","of our country was round these rituals."]],[1153,["I had nephews who used to come to Bombay for","their work."]],[1158,["Every time they went to Lucknow, they would","come with shaven heads."]],[1161,["I said, “What’s the matter?”"]],[1163,["He said, “There are many people in our family","who are old, and when they die we have to"]],[1166,["shave our heads.”"]],[1167,["So every time they went there somebody died,","so they came with shaven heads."]],[1172,["Like that such horrible rituals existed, and","even now in the South India there is a lot"]],[1179,["of rituals are there, terrible rituals, and","they cannot get out of it, they’re frightened."]],[1183,["If they get out of it then they might be sinners,","or they will go to hell."]],[1191,["So the Indian conditioning was, as far as","these rigidities were concerned for religion,"]],[1199,["to be on the right side in such a way that","we should not be caught up without doing this."]],[1207,["So early in the morning they’ll get up and","do the rituals, just without even thinking"]],[1212,["about what they’re doing."]],[1217,["But in the West the lifestyle is nothing but","rigidity, the whole lifestyle is; there’s"]],[1223,["no freedom anywhere."]],[1225,["And all that then was rewarded by these hippies","and other people, and all of them, and they"]],[1231,["fought it, and that thing went to another","extremes."]],[1235,["So from one extreme to another extreme they","went."]],[1240,["Now, how Shri Krishna’s advent changed it."]],[1246,["When Shri Krishna came on this Earth, He said","this is all a leela, it is just a play."]],[1257,["Because you are involved into it, you cannot","see the play."]],[1262,["But if you ascend – if you are in the water","you are afraid of the water, but if you get"]],[1270,["into the boat you can see the water, and if","you know how to swim you can even save the"]],[1277,["people who are in the water."]],[1280,["So He says that if you develop a witness state,","sakshi swarupata, if you develop that state"]],[1289,["then you see the whole thing as a drama."]],[1292,["Nothing affects you."]],[1294,["Nothing matters, you don’t worry about anything,","you see the problem above; you are, and you"]],[1301,["see the problem, and because you are out of","it, you can solve the problem."]],[1305,["This was His great advent, I would say, that","has taught the first step towards the ascent,"]],[1314,["is that you have to become a sakshi."]],[1318,["You have to become the witness."]],[1320,["Now let’s see in Sahaja Yoga."]],[1325,["In Sahaja Yoga there are different types of","people come from different areas, from different"]],[1332,["cultures, because the door is open to everyone."]],[1337,["Now if an Indian comes in, he will be all","the time watchful about others, and will say"]],[1346,["that “Mother, this man is not doing this,","this man is not doing that."]],[1351,["He should have done footsoaking.”"]],[1353,["He’ll find faults with others, all the time","saying that this man is not doing like this,"]],[1360,["and you know."]],[1362,["But in the West they start finding faults","with themselves."]],[1367,["And I receive letters, ten to twelve pages","sometimes, confessing what wrong they have"]],[1373,["done."]],[1374,["Who is interested to know, what wrongs you","have done?"]],[1379,["I mean, if a lotus is born, nobody wants to","know how many filthy things are inside the"]],[1389,["pond."]],[1390,["You are now a lotus."]],[1393,["But it’s so common that they think we must","confess, we must tell Mother what wrong we"]],[1400,["have done."]],[1401,["Every moment you are changing, so what is","there to confess?"]],[1405,["And the life is so formal, as I told you,","that people suffer from guilt for anything."]],[1413,["Apart from the influence of this Catholic","Church has conditioned you so much that even"]],[1421,["if you are not a Catholic, you’re a Protestant,","still you have guilt, and as a guilt you develop"]],[1426,["this left Vishuddhi."]],[1428,["So then this left Vishuddhi is Vishnumaya","– means what?"]],[1436,["Once you have this left Vishuddhi you develop","all the problems of the Vishnumaya, and one"]],[1443,["of them is the heart."]],[1447,["Because Vishnumaya is an active thing, She","is like electricity; and if you have Vishnumaya"]],[1455,["problem, then you become lethargic."]],[1459,["“Oh, I’m so guilty.”"]],[1461,["You become depressed."]],[1462,["That Vishnumaya Principle disappears from","you."]],[1466,["She’s the one who’s quick, fast, and She","gives the light, and announces to the whole"]],[1475,["world what Shri Krishna is."]],[1478,["While what happens with such people, Sahaja","yogis who come in, who feel guilty, they say,"]],[1485,["“Mother, You know, we thought that if we","do this then our ego will come up."]],[1491,["If we do any work outside and work in some","fields or in some villages, then our ego will"]],[1498,["come up."]],[1499,["So we don’t want to do it.”"]],[1502,["This is absurd."]],[1504,["It’s like you give light to some light,","and the light says that “I don’t want"]],[1509,["to give the light, because maybe this light","might develop an ego.”"]],[1517,["It is absurd."]],[1518,["But such absurd things Sahaja yogis tell Me."]],[1524,["For them one has to understand, to get out","of this left Vishuddhi is to become absolutely"]],[1530,["dynamic in Sahaja Yoga, go all out into Sahaja","Yoga."]],[1537,["Otherwise they can’t get rid of their left","Vishuddhis."]],[1540,["Left Vishuddhi is a thing that’s a very","depressive action on the whole being, and"]],[1551,["a person who has left Vishuddhi is always","a very slow person to do anything for Sahaja"]],[1558,["Yoga."]],[1559,["You have not been given light to hide it."]],[1562,["Christ has said that you don’t put light","under the table."]],[1568,["So you have been given light to work it out,","to be dynamic, to think what to do, how to"]],[1575,["arrange, how to organize."]],[1577,["But if you are guilty, then you will all the","time say, “Oh Mother, it’s very difficult,"]],[1583,["You know, this . . .” Always you’ll find","the other side of the whole joke, just to"]],[1589,["avoid."]],[1590,["Now for a Sahaja yogi is to witness himself,","first of all."]],[1593,["That is the introspection."]],[1595,["He should see for himself, “Where was I,","and I have come here.”"]],[1600,["Don’t indulge too much in the past, but","see the distance you have crossed in such"]],[1605,["a short time."]],[1607,["Now you have come into the Kingdom of God,","you have all the powers."]],[1612,["I don’t tell lies – it’s a fact."]],[1614,["I’ll give you an example, if Wolfgang allows","Me to say that."]],[1621,["Wolfgang was with Me when we were traveling","from Prague to Vienna and the plane, you see,"]],[1633,["he told Me that the plane is at ten-thirty,","but it was at nine-thirty; it was a mistake."]],[1636,["It’s all right, there can be mistake, of","course, that also is Shri Krishna’s style."]],[1641,["You can always do mistakes, doesn’t matter."]],[1645,["So we reached – I mean, why all these things","happen, see, to create an event, a ghatna."]],[1651,["So he was very upset about it that he told","Me a wrong time, and I reached there about"]],[1657,["fifteen minutes late."]],[1658,["And there was a ground hostess, horrible,","she started shouting at Me, saying all kinds,"]],[1663,["“It’s not fair, You don’t know,” this,","that and everything."]],[1666,["I just didn’t bother about it because I","knew that it was out of mistake we’ve done"]],[1673,["it."]],[1674,["And they could have taken away their plane","instead of shouting, but they kept the plane"]],[1677,["and shouted at Me, because she wanted to shout,","you see."]],[1684,["Then the plane was filled in with people and","it would not leave, so I asked the engineers."]],[1695,["They said, “It has been like this for the","half-an-hour."]],[1697,["We are trying to correct it."]],[1699,["It’s like this.”"]],[1700,["So it’s all right."]],[1702,["He said that “We’ll have to wait till","we put it right.”"]],[1709,["But because she shouted at Me, Wolfgang was","full of tears, you see; just look at this"]],[1716,["German having so many tears in his eyes!"]],[1718,["Then Alga was telling him that “It’s all","right, doesn’t matter."]],[1722,["It’s not your mistake.”"]],[1724,["He was feeling so sad that Mother has been","insulted like this by this lady, because of"]],[1730,["my mistake – I mean, it’s love."]],[1732,["Now the power of his love was so great."]],[1735,["At the same moment there were so many, to","about fifty people, Sahaja yogis standing"]],[1740,["on the balcony watching us."]],[1742,["We also felt and they also felt, but they","felt a tremendous cool breeze like a big blow"]],[1750,["came to them and blew upon them vibrations,","and they just got enamored."]],[1755,["And suddenly when they opened their eyes what","they find, the whole sky was filled with clouds."]],[1760,["There was not a single cloud."]],[1762,["In one second, in one second from where the","clouds came, God knows."]],[1767,["It was all completely filled with them."]],[1770,["Then they asked us to get out because they","could not do anything."]],[1774,["So when we came back it started raining."]],[1777,["When we came in, he got after that lady."]],[1780,["He said, “Now, whom are we to shout?"]],[1782,["We can’t catch our planes now.”"]],[1785,["And then they announced that all the flights","are cancelled."]],[1790,["So see the power of his love for his Mother","that the whole sky couldn’t bear it, you"]],[1797,["see, the, his eyes became the sky."]],[1800,["And in a second they said, “Mother, we have","never seen such a miracle, that there is not"]],[1806,["one single thing and the whole thing was filled","with this.”"]],[1811,["So you must know your powers."]],[1814,["That is what is – first of all witness yourself,","is the introspection."]],[1818,["See for yourself how many powers you have","got."]],[1823,["Now with your left Vishuddhi you will always","conclude, “Oh, how can I have any powers?"]],[1829,["After all, I have done this, I have done that.”"]],[1833,["Even if you give somebody hundred pounds and","you tell him that now you go to the market,"]],[1840,["buy something, he’ll say, “Oh, what’s","the use of this hundred pounds?” this, that."]],[1846,["Use it!"]],[1847,["As simple as that."]],[1849,["But then Sahaja yogis start saying that “No,","no, no, no."]],[1854,["Mother says, but how can I have?"]],[1855,["How can I have these powers, after all?"]],[1858,["It’s not possible."]],[1860,["I’m no good.”"]],[1861,["Because that left Vishuddhi’s all the time","telling that you are good for nothing."]],[1866,["It’s like a leaking hole in your brain that","takes away all the sense, and you accept it."]],[1876,["So first thing is to introspect yourself,","and see for yourself how many powers you have"]],[1882,["got."]],[1883,["Like in the beginning no Sahaja yogi would","give realization, in India."]],[1888,["Nobody would even touch anyone."]],[1891,["It so happened that My car failed and I was","late two hours, luckily, and there was a big"]],[1897,["meeting and they didn’t know what to do,","so they started giving realization to people."]],[1900,["And then they realized they can give realization;","otherwise they would not touch anyone."]],[1907,["Now you know that what you can do."]],[1911,["You also know that whatever you say happens."]],[1914,["Whatever you want you can get it."]],[1915,["Try, try, try!"]],[1916,["But if you don’t do it, then you’ll be","all the time half-baked."]],[1922,["Take the experience of your powers, see how","dynamic you are."]],[1927,["Don’t have formalities about it, just use","it fully, and you will be amazed that you"]],[1933,["have so many powers."]],[1936,["Somebody told Me that “Mother, You have","given a siddhi to Guido.”"]],[1939,["I have given siddhi to all of you."]],[1942,["I never discriminate; but it’s only he is","very brave, he’s used it left and right."]],[1946,["He uses left and right."]],[1948,["If you do not use your siddhis, what can I","do?"]],[1951,["I’ve given you all the siddhis, no doubt","about it, so try."]],[1957,["Like in the beginning Baba Mama told Me that","“How can I write a poem?"]],[1961,["I feel like writing but I am rather frightened,","because I could not even write an essay.”"]],[1966,["I used to write essay for all My brothers,","you see, when they were studying."]],[1972,["I was very good at languages."]],[1976,["But that’s what he said, and now look at","him!"]],[1978,["I told him, “You go ahead and write whatever","you write.”"]],[1980,["He said, “I may write something wrong.”"]],[1983,["“It doesn’t matter."]],[1984,["Write it.”"]],[1985,["In the same way, somebody wants to paint something,","one should not think how they will criticize"]],[1990,["or anything – just paint."]],[1995,["If you want to sing, just sing."]],[1996,["If you want to do anything, any manifestation,","just do it boldly."]],[2001,["Go in a big way."]],[2002,["You’ll be amazed at yourself how you have","achieved it and how you are doing it."]],[2006,["It has worked with so many artists, you know","that."]],[2010,["That day Debu told you about himself, and","in so many they can tell you that this has"]],[2015,["happened to them."]],[2016,["So now the first thing is to know that you","have powers."]],[2019,["Now believe in them."]],[2021,["Have faith in yourself."]],[2022,["If you have left Vishuddhi, this Vishnumaya","won’t work out."]],[2027,["But be like Vishnumaya."]],[2029,["Just give up this guilt."]],[2031,["“No, I am a Sahaja yogi."]],[2034,["I’m not an ordinary person.”"]],[2036,["People sometimes talk to Me and I say, “Do","you know what you are?”"]],[2041,["“What, Mother?”"]],[2042,["“You are a Sahaja yogi.”"]],[2044,["“Oh, I forgot.”"]],[2047,["“Now go and do it.”"]],[2052,["And the another style of this left Vishuddhi","is this, which one must understand, that it"]],[2060,["tries to give an explanation."]],[2062,["As I told you many a time, you tell somebody","that telephone to someone."]],[2066,["First they will say, “He may not be there,","Mother.”"]],[2069,["“Baba, you telephone!"]],[2071,["First find out if he may be there or may not","be there.”"]],[2076,["But they would not."]],[2079,["They would just avoid, and that is another","thing."]],[2082,["Vishnumaya never avoids, you have seen that."]],[2085,["Once She has to shine She shines, wherever","She is, whatever She is."]],[2090,["So in the same way we have to be like that."]],[2093,["We have to know that we are special people,","we are chosen, we are angelic and that we"]],[2100,["have entered into the Kingdom of God, and","it will all work out."]],[2104,["Sahaja Yoga is not meant for useless people."]],[2107,["As I told you, in Marathi, Tukaram has said,","“Yeddya gabalyache kam nave.”"]],[2113,["It’s not meant for lunatics and lousy people."]],[2116,["It’s meant for somebody who has tyala pahijet","jatiche."]],[2120,["You need people of character."]],[2122,["I know that there cannot be many like that,","but there is no place in God’s realm for"]],[2129,["many people, for all these useless people."]],[2133,["It’s only for something special."]],[2136,["These seats are reserved and you have got","your realization now, somehow."]],[2140,["So now try to understand that this Vishnumaya","Principle has to be expressed and has to be"]],[2147,["shown, and you introspect yourself: have I","done that or not?"]],[2150,["Don’t be afraid that they say that “But","our ego will come up.”"]],[2155,["Doesn’t matter."]],[2156,["You will also see your ego."]],[2159,["This is the second part of Shri Krishna’s","play, that in this Krita Yuga you see your"]],[2165,["ego."]],[2166,["There was a lady who was rather not very kind","to some Maharashtrian ladies."]],[2173,["So I told her, “You have got right side.”"]],[2176,["She wouldn’t believe."]],[2177,["She came to see Me in Rome, and she fell down","on right side, completely."]],[2182,["Then she realized that her right side was","not all right."]],[2188,["So to know that, whether you have a right","or a left, there’s a very good method, is"]],[2194,["of meditation."]],[2195,["Now the third situation is that you must accept","whatever is wrong with you."]],[2203,["If you do not accept, then you have not been","kind to yourself."]],[2208,["That is the central part of it, that you must","accept, “Yes, this is something wrong with"]],[2215,["me."]],[2216,["I have gone in this part I’m wrong, of my","Vishuddhi, or that part I’m wrong."]],[2221,["So now I have to improve.”"]],[2224,["Now, right Vishuddhi people will always try","to correct Me."]],[2229,["I’ve seen it."]],[2230,["It’s very simple for them."]],[2232,["If I say anything, “No.”"]],[2235,["First words."]],[2236,["Different types “no’s” there are."]],[2237,["Sometimes, “No!”"]],[2238,["Sometimes it is “No, no, no, no, no, no,","no, no, no, no, no, no, no!”"]],[2249,["They will contradict Me or try to put their","own idea, and then they discover that it was"]],[2259,["wrong; they should not have said it."]],[2261,["Say for example, if I say, “I saw these","things lying here.”"]],[2267,["They said, “No.”"]],[2268,["I said, “I saw with My own eyes and once","I see something, you know, it’s registers,"]],[2275,["it’s there.”"]],[2276,["“No.”"]],[2277,["I say, “All right, just try to find out.”"]],[2279,["“It’s there."]],[2280,["How is it we didn’t see?”"]],[2283,["I said, “Because your ‘no’ was written","on your eyes, I think, you couldn’t see"]],[2289,["anything.”"]],[2290,["And then they’ll pull their ears – that’s","the best."]],[2295,["But if you see that “This is a habit I have","of saying no to things.”"]],[2301,["So first of all, I also test you."]],[2305,["Supposing I say it is just now nine o’clock","in the night, you just say yes; let’s see"]],[2310,["what happens."]],[2311,["Try to see."]],[2313,["You see, I test you many a times like this","and then I see that some people – if I say"]],[2323,["so, all right, if it’s so, if Mother has","said, it is so."]],[2328,["And then it starts building up their faith","very well."]],[2332,["I can see they’re, clearly how they are","coming into the realm of real faith, and there"]],[2344,["when I say something absurd they’ll just","smile."]],[2346,["They know it is Mother is just testing us,","you see, so they just smile."]],[2352,["They wouldn’t do anything, but they’ll","just smile."]],[2356,["And then if it is so and if they don’t know,","they’ll say, “Yes, it must be."]],[2362,["Mother must have done this or said so.”"]],[2365,["So your testing time is there."]],[2368,["You have to test yourself."]],[2369,["As Mohammed Sahib has said, that your hands","will speak and they’ll give witness against"]],[2375,["you – so on your hands you will know."]],[2378,["Now these hands are the blessings of Shri","Krishna."]],[2383,["They come out from the same Vishuddhi, and","as you know the pelvic nerves serves it on"]],[2390,["all that."]],[2391,["And there are two chakras of one Lalita, another","Shri Chakras, all on these both sides; they"]],[2398,["also play into the hands of Shri Krishna."]],[2401,["With these hands we can feel the vibrations."]],[2406,["Now if your right Vishuddhi’s too strong","you may not feel, if your left Vishuddhi’s"]],[2411,["too strong you may not feel, but that doesn’t","mean that you haven’t got realization."]],[2417,["You have got."]],[2418,["You just work out your hands."]],[2421,["Now for working your hands, you have to see","that you don’t use them for useless things."]],[2427,["That’s very important, because you have","special hands."]],[2432,["These hands are the ones with which you spread","the collectivity."]],[2439,["Now for example, Italy example this: here","the people when they talk, they’ll go on"]],[2450,["… They don’t know anything what they are","saying, they only know their own, all their"]],[2454,["gestures, and they only can depict."]],[2457,["For a person who doesn’t know them, on they’ll","go on like this, like this, all the time."]],[2463,["So this should be reduced."]],[2465,["There’s no need to use your hands so much","all the time, like this, like that."]],[2469,["Little bit, but while using the hands also","it should be decent, it should be regulated,"]],[2475,["it should be","very indicative and useful."]],[2484,["Just showing off your hands is not good."]],[2488,["It is some sort of a theory came out, I was","told, that you must put your gestures into"]],[2493,["your hands and speak."]],[2496,["Is all right for people like Hitler, but not","for us."]],[2498,["For us we should be decent."]],[2501,["We should, whenever we have to say – now","for example, you want to point out something"]],[2504,["to someone, shouldn’t say “do this.”"]],[2506,["This is Shri Krishna’s finger, you can’t","use it like that."]],[2510,["Let them do, means supporting everything."]],[2515,["This looks better."]],[2518,["These hands are to be used for collectivity."]],[2520,["See, we say “namaste” when we meet others."]],[2525,["To thousands of people we can say “namaste.”"]],[2527,["But I don’t like the shaking hands business","because it’s no good."]],[2532,["Shaking hands doesn’t create any collectivity."]],[2534,["On the contrary, you might get all kinds of","pins and needles and all kinds of problems"]],[2538,["from others."]],[2540,["But when you talk to people also, with these","hands only you can feel them; with these hands"]],[2548,["only you can care for your children; with","these hands only you can suggest your softness,"]],[2556,["your sweetness, and also with the mouth – which","is of course is a part of the Vishuddhi, that’s"]],[2563,["different – but specially hands."]],[2566,["Your gestures and everything should show very","heartfelt emotions, and then only these gestures"]],[2576,["have some meaning."]],[2578,["Now in Sahaja Yoga as you know, you hold each","other’s hands and the vibration starts flowing"]],[2582,["among yourselves."]],[2584,["And you can also hear the tabla on your throbbings,","so that shows that they are the communication."]],[2593,["So these hands, which are really the beginning","of the collectivity – most important, I"]],[2599,["would say the most important things are the","hands, which act for your collectivity."]],[2608,["As far as you are concerned there are many","other angels and other ganas who are standing"]],[2616,["behind you."]],[2617,["They also, they extend their help to you whenever","you want to communicate something, they also"]],[2624,["do your jobs very well."]],[2626,["So whatever is expressed in your hand or through","your hand, they immediately pick up."]],[2636,["As you know that Vishuddhi has sixteen petals,","and all ear, nose, throat, eyes, all are guided"]],[2646,["by this."]],[2648,["Also the sub-plexus of this Vishuddhi is this","one, is the Hamsa Chakra."]],[2655,["So we have these eyes to see, eyes to communicate."]],[2662,["The pure eyes communicate pure love, purity."]],[2669,["With the pure eyes you can cleanse people,","with the pure eyes you can help others, you"]],[2677,["can bring peace."]],[2680,["The purification of the eyes takes place through","your Vishuddhi and Agnya."]],[2684,["Here both things have to work out."]],[2689,["The nose is very important."]],[2693,["Nose has to be pure, in the sense that you","should be able to discard whatever is smelling"]],[2703,["badly, and you should be able to accept whatever","is fragrant."]],[2708,["It’s very important, because nose is the","speciality of Shri Krishna, I would say, in"]],[2716,["the sense that He’s the Kubera, and the","Kubera has given the nose to the Goddess."]],[2723,["Some people have a bad habit of moving their","nose just to show disapproval or something"]],[2734,["like this, they go on doing like that."]],[2735,["This is very wrong, because then you are insulting","yourself, you’re insulting your Kubera power."]],[2743,["So you have to keep your nose in a dignified","manner."]],[2746,["It should be a dignified nose."]],[2749,["It should not be used for doing something","which is undignified, or which expresses contempt."]],[2756,["Then your teeth are very important."]],[2759,["You have thirty-two teeth, see: sixteen of","Krishna’s powers divided into, you can say,"]],[2768,["thirty-two."]],[2769,["These are your teeth on both the sides."]],[2775,["The right side is on top and the left down","below."]],[2780,["That is one thing we neglect very much in","the West, I must say."]],[2783,["In India it is not."]],[2784,["It is very much we neglect, and that’s what","we have to look after."]],[2789,["The reason for neglect is that, I would say,","is laziness, must be the laziness, but at"]],[2799,["least twice or thrice you must brush your","teeth."]],[2804,["Is important, that I need not say, but more","important is to change the brush."]],[2811,["Also you have to use butter, or salt and oil","to rub your gums."]],[2821,["If you rub your gums properly, you will never","have problems with your teeth and your gums."]],[2829,["Moreover, every time in the evening you must","again brush your teeth."]],[2835,["I’ve seen many people who come to Me in","the evening in the program, such a horrible"]],[2839,["smell from their mouth comes out."]],[2841,["It is not that it’s a disease but it is,","only thing is that they have not cleansed"]],[2846,["their teeth."]],[2848,["Also there are people who will not even brush","their teeth, and start eating breakfast."]],[2852,["I don’t know, it was another theory started,","I think, that you can eat your food without"]],[2857,["brushing."]],[2858,["Teeth are very important, and one must look","after them."]],[2863,["On the teeth it depends all the qualities","of your Vishuddhi."]],[2873,["So one has to look after the teeth in a proper","way, and should never clench and never show"]],[2882,["temper with the teeth."]],[2885,["It’s a very bad habit."]],[2886,["Also here is a gesture I have seen that if","they don’t like something, they just go"]],[2889,["on like this."]],[2890,["It’s a very wrong thing."]],[2892,["One should avoid that kind of a gesture, and","it’s very dangerous for your teeth."]],[2901,["So today’s lecture is more sort of medical,","I must say."]],[2910,["A person who is spiritually endowed has an","expression which can never be aggressive."]],[2926,["He may not be good-looking, may not be very,","a sort of a attractive personality, but the"]],[2934,["expression on the face is absolutely saintly."]],[2940,["That is also the blessings of Shri Krishna."]],[2946,["I have seen people after one year of realization,","and I was surprised how their faces were changed,"]],[2958,["that I could not recognize them who they were."]],[2963,["The whole thing becomes absolutely mild, soft,","peaceful and very joyous."]],[2970,["All the qualities of Shri Krishna can be expressed","on your face."]],[2977,["You can be sometimes mischievous to look at."]],[2980,["So many expressions there are which come on","the face, and give you a very sweet feeling."]],[2990,["But some people have a habit of looking in","the mirror all the time, which is very wrong,"]],[2996,["because it gives you a kind of a funny ego."]],[2999,["Is better to look at Shri Krishna’s photograph","than to look at your own faces, so that your"]],[3004,["face will become like that of Shri Krishna;","instead of you start looking in the mirror"]],[3008,["all the time."]],[3010,["What will become of you, God knows, because","maybe if you go to your past, God knows what"]],[3015,["you’ll become."]],[3016,["So also I’m thankful to psychiatrists that","they don’t like narcissism."]],[3021,["But it’s very dangerous to all the time","watch your face in the mirror, very dangerous."]],[3026,["It creates a very funny personality, that","you start telling yourself, “Oh, I’m Napoleon.”"]],[3031,["So you become Napoleon, and start behaving","like Napoleon."]],[3036,["Next day you find one Napoleon walks out of","the bathroom!"]],[3041,["So one has to be careful not to pay so much","attention and importance to your own self,"]],[3050,["but to your Self which is within, which is","your spirit."]],[3053,["And if you look after that side, then all","these things will happen in such a beautiful"]],[3060,["manner."]],[3061,["Also the hair are looked after by Shri Krishna."]],[3064,["Now you see, you know that He’s very fond","of anything that is like butter, so you have"]],[3071,["to put either butter or oil or something in","your hair."]],[3074,["If you don’t put it you’ll become bald."]],[3077,["What can – I mean it is after all a karma","phala."]],[3082,["If you don’t put oil, you’ll become bald."]],[3084,["So you have to put oil, and oil was put always","before in the West."]],[3089,["I see all these old films and all that, they’re","all oiled people."]],[3094,["But now of course, if you don’t want to","put oil in the daytime you can wash it off,"]],[3099,["but at least once a week you must oil your","head."]],[3105,["Shri Krishna’s star is Saturn, Shani."]],[3110,["They say that if He gets after somebody, then","nobody can be saved."]],[3119,["If Shri Krishna gets after someone, then nobody","can be saved."]],[3123,["In the same way, if Saturn gets after someone","then that person is finished, so we say it’s"]],[3129,["for sometimes, it is seven years He’s after","you, or sometimes two-and-a-half years after"]],[3133,["you."]],[3134,["So this Saturn of Shri Krishna is a, it’s","a quality within us that, supposing if somebody"]],[3146,["troubles us or does something, we don’t","have to do anything."]],[3151,["Now this Shri Krishna policy, this, we can","say, the Shri Krishna’s nature will work"]],[3160,["it out."]],[3162,["It will inform this all-pervading Power, and","through that this man or this woman, or this"]],[3172,["party or this organization which is trying","to trouble us will be hounded, while we’ll"]],[3176,["be just sitting doing nothing."]],[3177,["They’ll be just hounded till they jump in","the sea."]],[3183,["[missing part] plays around, but","He doesn’t forgive."]],[3186,["He doesn’t believe in forgiveness."]],[3188,["He says, “Now, you had enough of it.”"]],[3192,["He gives a big, big long rope to hang yourself,","but He never forgives."]],[3198,["One thing for definite, He never forgives."]],[3201,["As you must have seen in Mahabharata His own","judgment of things, you see, He doesn’t"]],[3206,["forgive."]],[3207,["He says, “You have to pay."]],[3208,["You have to pay for it.”"]],[3211,["Except when, when you transcend."]],[3215,["If you become a Sahaja yogi, if you have transcended","Vishuddhi, then He cannot do anything like"]],[3229,["that to you."]],[3230,["But if you have not, if there’s no ascent","you cannot be saved, you cannot be saved from"]],[3237,["Him."]],[3238,["They say once Mohammed Gajani came to loot","our country – I mean, it’s a story about"]],[3243,["the village folk."]],[3246,["And there he’s looted Somnath, a big temple","of ours, which had lots of gold, jewelry,"]],[3252,["everything in it."]],[3254,["So these brahmins were, you see, taking money","from all these people and looting them, and"]],[3259,["putting them in the temple and using them,","and the rest of the people were very poor."]],[3267,["So it was sort of a reaction in them, and","the story they tell like this: so this Mohammed"]],[3275,["Gajani looted Somnath, is the temple of Mahadeva."]],[3280,["Now Mahadeva never needs any ornaments or","anything, but they had put this there."]],[3286,["So Hanumana saw that Mahadeva got out of the","temple and was running, so Hanumana ran after"]],[3294,["Him."]],[3295,["Then at one point Mahadeva sat down, and Hanumana","came."]],[3300,["He said, “You are the God of Gods."]],[3303,["Why are You running?"]],[3304,["What are You afraid of?”"]],[3306,["He said, “You don’t know this Mohammed","Gajani?”"]],[3308,["He said, “No I don’t know.”"]],[3310,["“All right, hide behind a tree.”"]],[3311,["They hid behind a tree."]],[3313,["So this Mohammed Gajani came and sat down","– this is the folklore I’m telling, folk"]],[3317,["people tell – sat down under that tree."]],[3321,["And turning to Shri Krishna, he said, “This","horrible thing, if He gets after someone,"]],[3327,["who can be saved?"]],[3329,["Under my nose these brahmins were making money","and all that, putting it in Somnath temple,"]],[3333,["which was not to be done."]],[3335,["I couldn’t do anything, so He came, and","with this fellow after me I cannot be saved"]],[3341,["either, so I am running away from the temple.”"]],[3345,["So this is the story given by the villagers,","but which shows that if Shri Krishna is after"]],[3352,["somebody, then nobody can save that person,","he has to run away; because He has so many"]],[3356,["tricks and so many styles that you can’t","get out of it."]],[3361,["He’ll use His brains in so many manners,","and that He’ll put that person right who"]],[3366,["is trying to trouble you."]],[3368,["So you must have complete faith in the powers","of Shri Krishna which is within yourself,"]],[3376,["which is being aware now."]],[3377,["And also if you have ascended fully out of","this, then He will not trouble; but if you"]],[3383,["have left Vishuddhi He will trouble you, definitely."]],[3388,["If you have left Vishuddhi Shri Krishna will","definitely trouble you, and be careful."]],[3391,["So get rid of your left Vishuddhis now."]],[3394,["That’s very important."]],[3395,["Because then Shri Krishna will take your test","and will make you so miserable that you will"]],[3401,["not know why."]],[3402,["“Mother, You see, I did this, I did this","puja, I did this till, let’s see now, this"]],[3407,["is the situation in my family."]],[3409,["This is what happened.”"]],[3411,["“All right, are you a Catholic?”"]],[3414,["“Yes.”"]],[3415,["“Feel guilty?”"]],[3416,["“Yes.”"]],[3417,["“So have it.”"]],[3419,["What can I do?"]],[3420,["Shri Krishna cannot be controlled by anyone."]],[3423,["He does whatever He thinks proper and He is","meant to really punish much more than the"]],[3429,["Mother, I can tell you."]],[3432,["They say that She’s Adi Rudra, Adi Saumya:","She’s the one who’s very hard and also"]],[3438,["very, very soft, but up to a point."]],[3442,["He is not."]],[3444,["Nothing can convince Him."]],[3445,["Once you get into His control, that He’ll","see to it that you are put right, left, right,"]],[3452,["any way He’ll make you all right."]],[3454,["So one thing is there, that you should be","sure that you should have your Vishuddhis"]],[3460,["all right, first of all, and also get Shri","Krishna manifesting on others."]],[3467,["You don’t have to do anything."]],[3469,["He’ll look after you, everything, and work","it out."]],[3471,["But left Vishuddhi is a disease of the West."]],[3475,["I also feel so much from you all that I sometimes","feel like running away to India, because in"]],[3480,["India nobody feels guilty."]],[3482,["They don’t believe in feeling guilty."]],[3484,["“What is there?"]],[3485,["We have not murdered anyone."]],[3487,["Why should we feel guilty?”"]],[3489,["Here it is a disease with everyone, “I feel","guilty.”"]],[3492,["I don’t know who has introduced this idea,","maybe this Catholic Church, but carried too"]],[3499,["far."]],[3500,["So then we come to the Virata's point, is","here."]],[3506,["Before that we have to cross the Hamsa; without","that you cannot reach the Virat point."]],[3513,["So Hamsa is as you know very well, is the","discretion, divine discretion, which must"]],[3520,["be within you."]],[3523,["Once you develop that, then you don’t commit","mistakes."]],[3528,["You never commit mistakes – mistakes in","the sense you don’t do things which are"]],[3534,["again pushed back on you, or for which you","have to pay."]],[3536,["It’s just a very straightforward life."]],[3539,["“It’s so?"]],[3541,["It’s so.”"]],[3542,["With this discretion, absolutely you have","a complete understanding as to what has to"]],[3548,["be done and what not to be done."]],[3551,["And if that is established, a discretion is","established."]],[3554,["In many Sahaja yogis, I must say, discretion","has come even with their left Vishuddhi."]],[3559,["Even if they have left Vishuddhi they have","this discretion, they know what is right and"]],[3563,["what is wrong."]],[3564,["With that divine discretion, the first thing","that happens is that people get impressed"]],[3571,["by you."]],[3572,["It’s real collectivity, it impresses the","collectivity."]],[3574,["A person who has divine discretion, people","immediately see the wisdom of that person"]],[3579,["and think, “See now, this man, how could","he be?"]],[3582,["He’s so young, how could he be?"]],[3584,["He’s such a child, how could he be?”"]],[3587,["So this divine discretion which is the, here,","Hamsa Chakra’s speciality, when it starts"]],[3597,["manifesting then automatically you impress,","automatically you impress the collectivity."]],[3605,["This is a very important point one has to","know."]],[3609,["While introspecting yourself, you just see","if you have developed this quality of divine"]],[3615,["discretion or not."]],[3616,["For example, there are many I have seen when","they come to the program, they come and tell"]],[3620,["Me, “Mother, some Sahaja yogi told me that","‘You have a bhoot.’"]],[3623,["Have I got a bhoot in me?”"]],[3626,["I said, “Not at all."]],[3627,["How can there be any bhoot in you?”"]],[3630,["He may be having, but the divine discretion","is not to tell him just now, but to remove"]],[3636,["it."]],[3637,["So divine discretion gives you a complete","understanding what is the way to handle another"]],[3648,["personality, what is the way to handle a collective,","how to talk to others, how to impress on them"]],[3656,["the right things."]],[3657,["It’s a very, very expansive manifestation","in so many directions."]],[3665,["If you have no divine discretion, you’ll","start speaking what you should not speak,"]],[3669,["you’ll start saying at a time when you should","not say."]],[3674,["I mean, you’ll have no sense at all of any","direction."]],[3678,["So to have divine discretion is very important,","for which as you know, Hamsa Chakra physically"]],[3685,["as well mentally and also spiritually must","be kept all right."]],[3690,["In My Hamsas – we had one puja where I talked","about it."]],[3697,["The last is the Virat: that is the state you","have to reach."]],[3701,["Is the Virat is here in front, as you know."]],[3706,["And I was surprised when I went to Nepal,","which is a temple of Shiva there: despite"]],[3716,["they were worshipping Shiva they were putting","all the kumkum here."]],[3721,["So I thought that they don’t know why they","are putting, because even if you worship Shiva"]],[3726,["you must also worship here, the Virata."]],[3729,["They don’t put it here – here; because","they’re absolutely hundred percent only"]],[3737,["Shiva worshippers, so why should they put","it here?"]],[3742,["Because somebody who knows, who was gnostic,","has told them that this is the place of Virat."]],[3752,["Once you get into Virata, then all your ideas","of separating or differentiating goes away."]],[3769,["You do not have any more ideas of races left,","of nationality, of your city, of your village"]],[3779,["or anything."]],[3780,["At that stage you don’t belong to any place."]],[3787,["You belong to every place, and you don’t","belong to every place."]],[3789,["Such a situation comes in when you don’t","hanker after any particular food, you don’t"]],[3794,["like any particular type of people, you can","adjust yourself into any circumstances, into"]],[3804,["any families, into any kind of people."]],[3809,["You can live with drunkards."]],[3811,["I mean I have lived with drunkards – “lived”","means I have shaken hands at least with so"]],[3818,["many of them."]],[3820,["You can be with any kind of person."]],[3823,["Nothing bothers you because you are in the","Virata state; because everything is absorbed"]],[3828,["by the Virat, and you do not feel anything."]],[3832,["Whatever sort of person may be, you do not","feel it."]],[3835,["The Virat has to suffer, not you, and that","is what is the best state where I want all"]],[3841,["of you to reach, and to become absolutely","free."]],[3847,["Nothing can impress you, nothing can influence","you, nothing can dissuade you, but you stand"]],[3853,["on your self-esteem and understanding about","yourself, that you’re a Sahaja yogi and"]],[3858,["that you are connected with this power, and","you are a citizen of Kingdom of God."]],[3868,["At the Virata state there's no doubt left","about it, no doubt, because you become part"]],[3879,["and parcel of the whole, absolutely, and you","can affect anywhere."]],[3884,["If this finger is hurt, then this finger can","feel it."]],[3887,["In the same way such a person is felt everywhere,","and not only that, but that person can be"]],[3896,["effective everywhere."]],[3897,["For that state of reaching to Virat, one should","try to slowly, gradually, “Ya neti neti"]],[3905,["vachanaih nirgama avochu” say."]],[3907,["You have to go on saying, “This is not my","sister."]],[3909,["This is not my brother."]],[3911,["They are all my brothers."]],[3913,["They’re all my sisters."]],[3914,["I love them the same as my sisters and my","brothers."]],[3918,["This is not my family."]],[3920,["The whole Sahaja Yoga is my family.”"]],[3923,["The whole attention should move like that."]],[3927,["“This is not only mine, it is everybody’s."]],[3931,["It belongs to everyone."]],[3934,["Everybody has a right.”"]],[3936,["That sort of a thing, when it starts growing","from individual, what we call is the “vestiti"]],[3941,["tu sumestiti” in Sanskrit, they say “vestiti","tu sumestiti,” from individual to collective."]],[3948,["And such a personality then is the most effective","one for any kind of collective work."]],[3954,["I think for today it’s quite sufficient","for you to know about Vishuddhi Chakra."]],[3959,["I mean, I have talked about it thousands and","thousands of times, and now this is one of"]],[3965,["the sides which I wanted to say, because I","find that still there are people who do not"]],[3970,["understand that they have to rise above Vishuddhi."]],[3973,["Otherwise, if they do not ascend over Vishuddhi","they can never be proper Sahaja yogis, they’ll"]],[3980,["be always half-baked."]],[3982,["So we must try to rise above the Vishuddhi,","the discretion part."]],[3989,["Then at that point we can never doubt Sahaja","Yoga, can never doubt, and that’s how the"]],[3997,["doubtless awareness can come to us."]],[4001,["May God bless you."]],[4014,["All right."]],[4016,["Shri Krishna Puja is very small that way,","not such a long thing."]]]);
